#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:1
msgid "Speculative Decoding Guide"
msgstr "推测解码指南"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:3
msgid ""
"This guide shows how to use Speculative Decoding with vLLM Ascend. "
"Speculative decoding is a technique which improves inter-token latency in"
" memory-bound LLM inference."
msgstr "本指南介绍如何在 vLLM Ascend 中使用推测解码。推测解码是一种技术，用于改善受内存带宽限制的 LLM 推理中的 token 间延迟。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:7
msgid ""
"vLLM Ascend implements speculative decoding through a **proposer-"
"verifier** architecture:"
msgstr "vLLM Ascend 通过**提议器-验证器**架构实现推测解码："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:9
msgid ""
"**Proposer** (`vllm_ascend/spec_decode/`): Generates draft (speculative) "
"tokens using various methods — from simple n-gram matching to neural-"
"network-based draft models."
msgstr ""
"**提议器** (`vllm_ascend/spec_decode/`)：使用多种方法生成草稿（推测）token——从简单的 n-gram "
"匹配到基于神经网络的草稿模型。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:10
msgid ""
"**Rejection Sampler** (`vllm_ascend/sample/`): Verifies draft tokens "
"against the target model's output, accepting matches and rejecting "
"mismatches, with optional optimizations including [Block Verify and "
"Entropy Verify](#block-verify-and-entropy-verify)."
msgstr ""
"**拒绝采样器** (`vllm_ascend/sample/`)：根据目标模型的输出验证草稿 "
"token，接受匹配项并拒绝不匹配项，可选优化包括[块验证和熵验证](#block-verify-and-entropy-verify)。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:12
msgid "The following speculative decoding methods are supported:"
msgstr "支持以下推测解码方法："

