#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:26
msgid "Common Configuration"
msgstr "通用配置"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:28
msgid ""
"All speculative decoding methods are configured through the "
"`speculative_config` parameter when initializing the model or starting "
"the server:"
msgstr "所有推测解码方法都通过初始化模型或启动服务器时的 `speculative_config` 参数进行配置："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:30
msgid ""
"**`method`** (str, required): The speculative decoding method. Must be "
"one of the supported method names listed in the table above."
msgstr "**`method`** (str, 必需)：推测解码方法。必须是上表中列出的受支持方法名称之一。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:31
msgid ""
"**`num_speculative_tokens`** (int, required): Number of speculative "
"tokens to generate per forward pass. Auto-filled from the draft model's "
"`n_predict` config (e.g., MTP) or `suffix_decoding_max_tree_depth` "
"(suffix method) when available."
msgstr ""
"**`num_speculative_tokens`** (int, 必需)：每次前向传播生成的推测 token 数量。当可用时，从草稿模型的 "
"`n_predict` 配置（例如 MTP）或 `suffix_decoding_max_tree_depth`（后缀方法）自动填充。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:32
msgid ""
"**Note**: For PD Separation deployment, `num_speculative_tokens` should "
"be subject to one of the following conditions:"
msgstr "**注意**：对于 PD 分离部署，`num_speculative_tokens` 应满足以下条件之一："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:34
msgid ""
"Hybrid Mamba models (e.g., Qwen-Next and Qwen3.5 series): "
"`num_speculative_tokens` should be equal on P nodes and D nodes."
msgstr "混合 Mamba 模型（例如 Qwen-Next 和 Qwen3.5 系列）：P 节点和 D 节点上的 `num_speculative_tokens` 应相等。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:35
msgid ""
"Other models: `num_speculative_tokens` on P nodes should be 1, and "
"`num_speculative_tokens` on D nodes should be greater or equal to 1."
msgstr "其他模型：P 节点上的 `num_speculative_tokens` 应为 1，D 节点上的 `num_speculative_tokens` 应大于或等于 1。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:36
msgid ""
"**`model`** (str, optional): Path or HF repo ID for the draft model. "
"Required for `eagle`, `eagle3`, `dflash`, `medusa`, and `draft_model`. "
"Automatically resolved for `mtp` (reuses target model), `ngram`, "
"`suffix`, and `extract_hidden_states`."
msgstr ""
"**`model`** (str, 可选)：草稿模型的路径或 HF 仓库 ID。对于 "
"`eagle`、`eagle3`、`dflash`、`medusa` 和 `draft_model` 是必需的。对于 "
"`mtp`（重用目标模型）、`ngram`、`suffix` 和 `extract_hidden_states` 会自动解析。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:37
msgid ""
"**`draft_tensor_parallel_size`** (int, optional): Tensor parallelism size"
" for the draft model. Can only be `1` or the same as the target model's "
"tensor parallel size."
msgstr ""
"**`draft_tensor_parallel_size`** (int, 可选)：草稿模型的张量并行大小。只能为 `1` "
"或与目标模型的张量并行大小相同。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:38
msgid ""
"**`disable_padded_drafter_batch`** (bool, default: `False`): Disable "
"input padding for speculative decoding. If set to `True`, speculative "
"input batches can contain sequences of different lengths, which may only "
"be supported by certain attention backends. **Note:** Only effective with"
" `eagle`, `eagle3`, `mtp`, `dflash`, `draft_model`, and "
"`extract_hidden_states` methods."
msgstr ""
"**`disable_padded_drafter_batch`** (bool, 默认值: `False`)：禁用推测解码的输入填充。如果设置为"
" `True`，推测输入批次可以包含不同长度的序列，这可能仅受某些注意力后端支持。**注意：** 仅对 "
"`eagle`、`eagle3`、`mtp`、`dflash`、`draft_model` 和 `extract_hidden_states` "
"方法有效。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:40
msgid ""
"**Offline inference** — pass `speculative_config` as a Python dict to "
"`LLM()`:"
msgstr "**离线推理** — 将 `speculative_config` 作为 Python 字典传递给 `LLM()`："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:55
msgid ""
"**Online serving** — pass `--speculative-config` (or `-sc`) as a JSON "
"string:"
msgstr "**在线服务** — 将 `--speculative-config`（或 `-sc`）作为 JSON 字符串传递："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:62
msgid ""
"[!NOTE] On Ascend NPUs, the `npu_fused_infer_attention_score` operator "
"supports a maximum of 16 tokens per decode round. Therefore, "
"`(num_speculative_tokens + 1)` must be ≤ 15."
msgstr ""
"[!NOTE] 在 Ascend NPU 上，`npu_fused_infer_attention_score` 算子每轮解码最多支持 16 个 "
"token。因此，`(num_speculative_tokens + 1)` 必须 ≤ 15。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:65
msgid "Speculating by matching n-grams in the prompt"
msgstr "通过匹配提示词中的 n-gram 进行推测"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md:67
msgid ""
"The following code configures vLLM Ascend to use speculative decoding "
"where proposals are generated by matching n-grams in the prompt."
msgstr "以下代码配置 vLLM Ascend 使用推测解码，其中候选 token 通过匹配提示词中的 n-gram 生成。"

